The application should be sent as a single PDF file containing: 
1. A recent CV that must contain name, academic qualification with grade/marks, postal address, email id and phone number along with other relevant information;
2. Self-attested copies of all testimonials (original degree certificates, mark sheets and proof of date of birth);
3. A copy of the identity card (for verification of name with photo);
4. Thesis report (if any) and/or publications (if any).

The available documents do not specify: the office hours for Sabarno Sinha, who is the JU-SYLFF Project Assistant.
